[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3735640218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114840#issuecomment-3735640218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114840","id":3735640218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eqVia","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T20:04:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T20:04:26Z","body":"It makes sense to expect `DisplayServer.screen_get_orientation()` to return the current device orientation when the screen orientation is set to SENSOR.\n\nThat said, how is the user supposed to distinguish whether the returned value represents a fixed orientation (e.g. forced landscape) or a sensor-based orientation where the device is currently in landscape at that moment?\n\nWe may need additional constants to express this maybe something like DEVICE_LANDSCAPE and DEVICE_PORTRAIT (or similar).\n\nBTW, how does this behave on iOS? Does it return the actual device orientation there?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3735640218/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4787349664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114840#issuecomment-4787349664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114840","id":4787349664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHVkooA","user":{"login":"FuzzyHerbivore","id":44259520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjU5NTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44259520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore","html_url":"https://github.com/FuzzyHerbivore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FuzzyHerbivore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T08:30:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T08:30:47Z","body":"Same behavior in iOS as in Android, I just ran into this issue there in Godot 4.7. The [docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_displayserver.html#class-displayserver-method-screen-get-orientation) misleadingly claim that screen_get_orientation \"Returns the screen's current orientation.\" which I interpreted as the actual orientation, not the config setting.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4787349664/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]